<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h2 data-lake-id="I0g4j" id="I0g4j" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uba1ab329" id="uba1ab329">🍄 𝐆𝐃𝐍 𝐇𝐲𝐛𝐫𝐢𝐝 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u25f14c11" id="u25f14c11"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaea6e26e" id="uaea6e26e">全自注意力能够基于内容直接访问每一个先前词元，但其词元混合的计算成本随序列长度呈二次增长，键值缓存则在自回归生成过程中线性增长</span></strong></p><ul list="u120454de"><li fid="uee3ffec8" data-lake-id="u791950b2" id="u791950b2"><span data-lake-id="u0aa2a3f7" id="u0aa2a3f7">滑动窗口注意力以有界的局部感受野替代全局访问，从而降低计算成本和缓存占用。然而，窗口之外的信息只能通过跨层传播间接传递，由此形成高效局部处理与持久的内容相关记忆之间的矛盾</span></li><li fid="uee3ffec8" data-lake-id="u263e837b" id="u263e837b"><span data-lake-id="u31bd895e" id="u31bd895e">为缓解这一矛盾，采用 Gated DeltaNet 与全局注意力按层混合的架构。GDN 将前缀压缩为固定大小的循环状态，并根据当前内容更新该状态；交错设置的全局注意力层则保留词元级直接检索能力，而这种能力难以由有限状态的循环记忆精确复现</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc9adaa40" id="uc9adaa40"><strong><span data-lake-id="u55ef5a5c" id="u55ef5a5c">门控 Delta 递推：线性注意力可视为一种快权重记忆，通过矩阵状态存储键值关联。对于每个注意力头，设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1ddcfd71b437c72e7498c14355238960.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SPOCl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb789627" id="ubb789627">，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5081336f7871f1a1d579f1eab24579f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aoCyQ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a603342" id="u7a603342">。按照实现中的约定，GDN 维护状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd1084bc98f6e0867ce60f02b34bf5e02.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sAePD%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u33f41fcb" id="u33f41fcb">，这一状态表示与原始公式采用的表示互为转置，并按照以下门控 Delta 规则更新</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ubb2a43f4" id="ubb2a43f4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fefc1293684cf4dfbd33f1332535a5de5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mhd3g%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ude80c2bd" id="ude80c2bd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0476aeaf1f8c8780fa32c223a9c3763.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b5mcl%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u145aa97e" id="u145aa97e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7f69b65eb889f7589a5b41eb14d3479c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IbhXL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uad3aa417" id="uad3aa417" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd481bdbfeef02c60c5e08d75be795d8c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UVyzt%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7873f606"><li fid="uee9eda68" data-lake-id="ua43c4b23" id="ua43c4b23"><span data-lake-id="u3956eb0d" id="u3956eb0d">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb77064fbd2d8d47a6f1575f354c7f5c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LURjT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5402203" id="ud5402203">是数据依赖的衰减系数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc84f1e35fd4d7410415bf60b49b2e1bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tLovz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f94c58a" id="u7f94c58a">控制 Delta 更新。上述递推等价于</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uac3172d9" id="uac3172d9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c5e5220c42a9bb626b4f83ade4209f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ErIwY%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4e949d9c"><li fid="uf66ecf38" data-lake-id="u16a9124a" id="u16a9124a"><span data-lake-id="u70fb67a8" id="u70fb67a8">两个门控发挥互补作用。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1cfef2d" id="ud1cfef2d" style="color: #5C0036">衰减系数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F934371f608c3b1245db5f46f4369b40b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jNL6P%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud838cc3f" id="ud838cc3f" style="color: #5C0036">从全局上控制已有状态的保留时间；Delta 项则先估计当前状态中已与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F791341ae1090527ea4e2c87ead5420ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yQSA8%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6aa72a5a" id="u6aa72a5a" style="color: #5C0036">关联的值，再仅写入相应残差。因此，重复或相似的键会更新已有的关联，而非无界地累加外积</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2d34de0f" id="u2d34de0f">。这种有针对性的擦除与写入操作，使 GDN 区别于纯加法形式的线性注意力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6af9c537" id="u6af9c537" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793452465380-ea12696b-d9ea-429f-abc3-70c868667f95.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua3b3ddc0-f9b4-4b33-89c1-7d6667ef799%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u250790a3-eac7-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A547%2C%22height%22%3A358%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A154400%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A946%2C%22originHeight%22%3A620%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECAYGATEOANDWRITEGATEBCONTROLTHERECURRENTUPDATE%2CWHILEASIGMOIDOUTPUTGATEMODULATESTHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A5%2C%22y%22%3A567%2C%22width%22%3A933%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SHORTCAUSALCONVOLUTIONSQUERIESANDKEVSAREL2-NOMALIZEDBEFORETHEGATEDDELTARECURRENCE.THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A7%2C%22y%22%3A546%2C%22width%22%3A929%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IGURE2%3ATHEGATEDDETANETTOKENMIXERTHEPROJECTEDQUERY%2CKEY%2CANDVALUESTREAMSPASSTHROUGH%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A524%2C%22width%22%3A925%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZERO-CENTEREDRMS-NORMALIZEDOUTPUT.%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A591%2C%22width%22%3A376%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ZERO-CENTEREDRMSNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A339%2C%22y%22%3A129%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GATEDDELTARULE%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SI1U%22%2C%22x%22%3A275%2C%22y%22%3A307%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTGATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A529%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV%22%2C%22x%22%3A276%2C%22y%22%3A350%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B9%9DLIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A529%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A403%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SI1U%22%2C%22x%22%3A402%2C%22y%22%3A312%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A621%2C%22y%22%3A394%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A272%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONV%22%2C%22x%22%3A404%2C%22y%22%3A352%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A404%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%E4%B8%AAK%22%2C%22x%22%3A281%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L2%22%2C%22x%22%3A281%2C%22y%22%3A267%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A515%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C0.8214%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u014f0198%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue93c3701" id="ue93c3701"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ec27f1f" id="u8ec27f1f">GDN 的参数化：给定归一化后的残差流输入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7ae51c3a176287b8e07e41a79c6d7446.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yTpLr%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a85fe8b" id="u6a85fe8b">，GDN 先进行可学习的投影，再应用短核逐通道因果卷积，以计算内容特征</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u30b5d8b7" id="u30b5d8b7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BL2Norm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_q%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41f201e57313592bef9a2682a6fdb45a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LSpW5%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u719d4994" id="u719d4994" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BL2Norm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F31ad3ddcd49d90b25b1bb01207540154.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XDhe9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u35a64546" id="u35a64546" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_v%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79c34a4773e9a13ecd9e08137c1aaed7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cXS32%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u6ca69ec2"><li fid="udc56b3aa" data-lake-id="u5e4449eb" id="u5e4449eb"><span data-lake-id="u6fff3081" id="u6fff3081">短核卷积在信息被压缩进循环状态之前，引入显式的局部归纳偏置。L2 归一化约束查询和键的幅值，并提高秩一 Delta 状态转移的稳定性。写入强度与衰减系数分别参数化为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubcd2721a" id="ubcd2721a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F061ea199ddbce1a483b9ac4c6afb20b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22npOPZ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud46dfbdf" id="ud46dfbdf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cexp%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn-%5C%5Cexp(A)%5C%5C%2C%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftplus%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2Bb_%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5b2a35ca71054594cd96ad44e8b679e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZD6O0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue8a3e230"><li fid="u10f105ec" data-lake-id="uc1d65b24" id="uc1d65b24"><span data-lake-id="u03753a13" id="u03753a13">在各注意力头上独立执行递推后，对各头的输出进行归一化，并通过依赖输入的输出门控加以调制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u36eb6e6a" id="u36eb6e6a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_o%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_z%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff43494ae83941d88433b2c436c2ad5e9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hOXeB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u34cab20e"><li fid="u78bb9fd7" data-lake-id="u4c402f01" id="u4c402f01"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3b489d7" id="ub3b489d7" style="color: #270070">原始 GDN 采用 SiLU 输出门控，作者采用有界 sigmoid 门控。沿用 Qwen3-Next 的设计，采用零中心 RMSNorm，以约束 RMSNorm 权重的增长。模型中的其余所有 RMSNorm 层也统一采用这一形式</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u34dd4464" id="u34dd4464"><span data-lake-id="uaded0f13" id="uaded0f13">在模型层面，该混合架构在全注意力层中保留旋转位置嵌入。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe94eb17" id="ufe94eb17" style="color: #270070">采用 RoPE 的模型与不使用位置编码的 NoPE 变体，在预训练阶段表现差异较小；但在完成后训练后，NoPE 变体出现无休止生成的比例显著更高，因而更容易发生生成无法终止的问题</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufbc03bc1" id="ufbc03bc1">。在每四层中设置一个全注意力层，其余三层采用 GDN。这一层间配置在效率与质量之间取得较好的平衡，其中，周期性设置的全注意力层对长上下文性能尤为重要</span></p><p data-lake-id="u17a5e420" id="u17a5e420"><span data-lake-id="u7969666c" id="u7969666c">为提高效率，使用 FlashQLA 优化 GDN 计算核。FlashQLA 是一个基于 TileLang 的融合线性注意力计算核库。在 NVIDIA GPU 上的多种配置下，相较于 FLA 的 Triton 计算核，FlashQLA 的前向计算加速比达到 2–3 倍，反向计算加速比约为 2 倍</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua699d9e1" id="ua699d9e1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793452520156-a7b8c075-fe2f-404e-9289-c43bd49a08cc.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubea9a4a2-f488-45bd-832f-976db93469f%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u250790a3-eac7-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A931.2%2C%22height%22%3A141%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A77141%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1164%2C%22originHeight%22%3A176%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22REASONINGMULTILINGUA%22%2C%22x%22%3A644%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A221%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MMLU-PROSUPERGPQA%22%2C%22x%22%3A219%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%3A247%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EVALPLUSMULTIPL-E%22%2C%22x%22%3A883%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%3A201%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MATHGSMSK%22%2C%22x%22%3A480%2C%22y%22%3A5